with browser dev tools. The forum suggests that's how the app's own payloads are visible."],"durationSeconds":6.609372625,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HnjdkYFxmobdqNKPUvssUa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
